g insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, permanent neonatal diabetes diabetes mellitus, maturity-onset diabetes of the young type 10 and hyperproinsulinemia. There is a read-through gene, INS-IGF2, which overlaps with this gene at the 5' region and with the IGF2 gene at the 3' region. [provided by RefSeq, May 2020]"}],"swissProtAccessions":["P01308"],"symbol":"INS","synonyms":["IDDM","ILPR","IRDN","IDDM1","IDDM2","PNDM4","MODY10"],"taxId":"9606","taxname":"Homo sapiens","transcriptCount":4,"transcriptTypeCounts":[{"count":4,"type":"PROTEIN_CODING"}],"type":"PROTEIN_CODING"}
